# Formspree form ID used by the Inscription page to send registration
# submissions by email. Create a free form at https://formspree.io,
# then copy the ID from your form's endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX)
# into VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID below.
#
# Local dev: copy this file to .env and fill in the value.
# Vercel: add the same variable under Project Settings → Environment Variables.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
